    {
      "id": "simultaneous",
      "label": "-(으)면서",
      "explanation": "Use -(으)면서 for two actions happening at the same time, usually by the same subject. Add -으면서 after a consonant and -면서 after a vowel or ㄹ. 듣다 becomes 들으면서. The final verb carries tense and politeness. Review of Lesson 8.",
